{"blocked_hypothesis_ids":["hyp_fourgram_capacity_sweep"],"created_at":"2026-07-23T00:30:00-07:00","gap_id":"gap_no_fivegram_order_lever","missing_capabilities":["train.py implements bigram, trigram and fourgram n-gram value-embedding orders only (NGRAM_BIGRAM_MULT / NGRAM_TRIGRAM_MULT / NGRAM_FOURGRAM_MULT). There is NO fivegram path (grep: 0 occurrences of fivegram / NGRAM_FIVE / 5gram). Testing the next rung of the order ladder requires new code, so it was flagged rather than faked."],"priority":"high","question":"Does the n-gram ORDER ladder continue past 4-gram? The 4-gram order just produced SOTA #4 (-0.001307 on 6 hold-out seeds) after being wrongly retracted, so 5-gram is the obvious next rung -- but it cannot be tested.","recommended_solution":"Add a fivegram table/hash/gate/optimizer-group mirroring the fourgram path: fivegram_table_size = vocab * NGRAM_FIVEGRAM_MULT, K=2 factored half-dim tables on the same layers, disjoint 10-prime hash family, and CRITICALLY a correctly zero-initialised fivegram_gate in GPT.init_weights (the missing fourgram_gate init is exactly what invalidated the 4-gram axis for the whole first campaign). Then re-reconcile and screen with the standard funnel. VRAM is now affordable thanks to rowwise+sparse-grad.","status":"open"}
